      "question": "Lesion",
      "preferredVariantId": "v-6de784415e",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "v-6de784415e",
          "answer": "Causes sensory loss over the lower face, mandibular teeth and general sensation from the anterior two-thirds of the tongue; motor involvement weakens mastication and the jaw deviates toward the affected side on opening.",
